  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Special measure in favour of contributing to the availability and equitable access to COVID-19 vaccines in low and lower-middle income countries through the COVAX Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the amendment is to extend the implementation period of the decision (LMO-EOI) and to introduce substantial modifications in the scope of the action to allow for a reallocation of funds from COVAX to the African Vaccine Manufacturing Accelerator (AVMA) and global immunisation program through the GAVI contract NDICI/2021/427-631</narrative>
  </description>
